# =============== #
# Unity generated #
# =============== #
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/

# Unity 自動救援場景（不進版控）
/[Aa]ssets/_Recovery/
/[Aa]ssets/_Recovery.meta

# Unity 個人設定（很常變，不進版控）
/UserSettings/EditorUserSettings.asset

# MemoryCaptures can get excessive in size.
# They also could contain extremely sensitive data
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/

# Recordings can get excessive in size
/[Rr]ecordings/

# Autogenerated Jetbrains Rider plugin
/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*

# Visual Studio cache directory
.vs/

# Gradle cache directory
.gradle/

# Packed Addressables
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/*/*.bin*

# Addressables 編譯後會自動產生的檔案（不進版控）
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/link.xml*

# Temporary auto-generated Android Assets
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa.meta
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/*

# =============================================== #
# Visual Studio / MonoDevelop / Sublime generated #
# =============================================== #
ExportedObj/
*.svd
*.userprefs
*.csproj
*.pidb
*.suo
*.sln
*.user
*.unityproj
*.booproj
*.sublime-project
/.vscode/

# ============ #
# OS generated #
# ============ #
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Icon?
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# ============== #
# Game specific  #
# ============== #
Bin/

# =========== #
# Other files #
# =========== #
*~
# Unity UPM Samples 會使用 `Samples~` 資料夾，不能被 `*~` 忽略
!Packages/**/Samples~/
!Packages/**/Samples~/**
# 但 macOS 會自動產生 `.DS_Store`，不應該進版控（避免 `git status` 一直跳）
Packages/**/Samples~/**/.DS_Store
Packages/**/Samples~/**/.DS_Store?
.idea/
codex-hello-loop/
PlanningWithFiles/
AGENTS.md
AGENTS__.md
UIToolkitSpec.md
*.dwlt
